{"id":"H3438","lemma":"יִשְׁוָה","transliteration":"yishvah","sayIt":"yish-vah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ishvah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.46.17;\nson of: Asher (H0836);\nbrother of: Imnah (H3232), Ishvi (H3440), Beriah (H1283) and Serah (H8294)\n§ Ishuai or Isuah = \"he will resemble\"\nthe 2nd son of Asher","glosses":["ishvah"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-46","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishvah","kjv":"and Ishuah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishvah","kjv":"and Ishuai"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 46:17","note":"The sons of Asher: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, and Serah their sister. The sons of Beriah: Heber and Malchiel.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:30","note":"The sons of Asher: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, and Beriah. Serah was their sister.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0836","lemma":"אָשֵׁר","transliteration":"asher","gloss":"Asher"},{"id":"H1283","lemma":"בְּרִיעָה","transliteration":"beriah","gloss":"Beriah"},{"id":"H3232","lemma":"יִמְנָה","transliteration":"yimnah","gloss":"Imnah"},{"id":"H3440","lemma":"יִשְׁוִי","transliteration":"yishvi","gloss":"Ishvi"},{"id":"H8294","lemma":"שֶׂ֫רַח, שָׂ֫רַח","transliteration":"serach","gloss":"Serah"},{"id":"H0805","lemma":"אֲשׁוּרִי","transliteration":"ashuri","gloss":"Asshurim"},{"id":"H0843","lemma":"אָשֵׁרִי","transliteration":"asheri","gloss":"Asherite"},{"id":"H1284","lemma":"בְּרִיעִי","transliteration":"berii","gloss":"Beriite"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}